OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed for 'wicked' abuse
OL,4,Aof young child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped and sexually assaulted
OL,7,Fa young child has been jailed for 19
OL,8,Fyears by a judge who called his
OL,9,Foffences "wicked".
OL,11,FTrevor New-Watts, 57, of George Pope
OL,12,FClose in Norwich, was investigated by
OL,13,Fpolice after the girl told a relative
OL,14,Fabout the abuse in 2022.
OL,16,FHe was found guilty of two counts of
OL,17,Frape of a child, four counts of sexual
OL,18,Fassault of a child and two counts of
OL,19,Fcausing a child under 13 to engage in
OL,20,Fsexual activity, and was sentenced at
OL,21,FNorwich Crown Court on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
