OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed for 'wicked' abuse
OL,4,Aof young child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA relative of the victim said New-Watts
OL,7,Fhad stolen the girl's childhood, adding
OL,8,Fshe had been "left with physical,
OL,9,Femotional, and psychological injury and
OL,10,Ftrauma".
